<li>
    <p>
        Provide specific examples of the human activities that contributed to a loss of biodiversity.
    </p>
</li>
<li>
    <p>
        The Changing Ecosystems game addresses only some consequences of biodiversity decline. Describe at least one consequence not addressed in the game.
    </p>
</li>
<li>
<p>
    Using what you have learned from this investigation, make a claim regarding the categories of what can impact ecosystem stability.
</p>
</li>
